        {
          "name": "Visitor",
          "type": "TriangleVisitor&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "template<TriangleVisitor> void",
      "docs": "Visit all triangles transformed into the specified space. Triangles will have standard winding, regardless of heightfield scale.\n@param QueryBounds Bounding box in which we want to produce triangles, in HeightField space\n@param QueryTransform Transforms from HeightField space to query space (usually the other object's space)\n@param CullDistance The distance at which we can ignore triangles\n@param Visitor void(const FTriangle& Triangle, const int32 TriangleIndex, const int32 VertexIndex0, const int32 VertexIndex1, const int32 OutVertexIndex2)"
